    <title>Dwm</title>
    <url>/2026/02/02/Dwm/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<blockquote>
<p>[2026-9-28] 我已经转移至vxwm,实在不想配置可以在github上找vxwm的配置用(开箱即用的)<br>我用的是vxwm基于dwm衍生，完全就是照着dwm配置文件格式写的</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="Dwm"><a href="#Dwm" class="headerlink" title="Dwm"></a>Dwm</h2><p>dwm是x11下的动态调节窗口管理器(dwm is a dynamic window manager for X.)</p>
<h3 id="安装-Install"><a href="#安装-Install" class="headerlink" title="安装(Install)"></a>安装(Install)</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://git.suckless.org/dwm  dwm-btw  <span class="comment">#克隆仓库到本地,dmw是C写的需要到克隆本地编译</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://git.suckless.org/st  st-btw    <span class="comment">#dwm的默认终端</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://git.suckless.org/dmenu  dmenu-btw      <span class="comment">#软件的启动器</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://git.suckless.org/dwmblocks  dmwblocks-btw   <span class="comment">#dwm的状态栏</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S base-devel <span class="comment">#安装c语言环境</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S feh <span class="comment">#设置壁纸,看图工具</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S git <span class="comment">#管理版本</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="下面可以安装也可以不安装"><a href="#下面可以安装也可以不安装" class="headerlink" title="下面可以安装也可以不安装"></a>下面可以安装也可以不安装</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd (字体)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S xorg-xinit  <span class="comment">#tty启动(有启动器可以不安装)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<hr>
<h3 id="编译"><a href="#编译" class="headerlink" title="编译"></a>编译</h3><h4 id="dwm"><a href="#dwm" class="headerlink" title="dwm"></a>dwm</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> dwm-btw &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">sudo</span> make clena install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h4 id="st"><a href="#st" class="headerlink" title="st"></a>st</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> st-btw &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">sudo</span> make clena install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h4 id="dmenu"><a href="#dmenu" class="headerlink" title="dmenu"></a>dmenu</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> dmenu-btw &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">sudo</span> make clena install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h4 id="dwmblocks"><a href="#dwmblocks" class="headerlink" title="dwmblocks"></a>dwmblocks</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> dwmblock-btw &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">sudo</span> make clena install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h4 id="创建-xinitrc"><a href="#创建-xinitrc" class="headerlink" title="创建.xinitrc"></a>创建.xinitrc</h4><figure class="highlight txt"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd &amp;&amp;  touch $HOME/.xinitrc</span><br><span class="line">echo &#x27;exec dwm&#x27; &gt; $HOME/.xinitrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<hr>
<h3 id="进入DWM前准备"><a href="#进入DWM前准备" class="headerlink" title="进入DWM前准备"></a>进入DWM前准备</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">disable</span> -now 启动器</span><br><span class="line">或者</span><br><span class="line">Ctrl + Alt + F3 进入另一个<span class="built_in">tty</span>会话</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h6 id="这是xinitrc的配置"><a href="#这是xinitrc的配置" class="headerlink" title="这是xinitrc的配置"></a>这是xinitrc的配置</h6><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">vim <span class="variable">$HOME</span>/.xinitrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h6 id="复制下面的配置就行-复制完按-wq退出"><a href="#复制下面的配置就行-复制完按-wq退出" class="headerlink" title="复制下面的配置就行,复制完按:wq退出"></a>复制下面的配置就行,复制完按:wq退出</h6><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#!/bin/sh</span><br><span class="line"># --- 输入法环境变量（必须在启动任何 X 客户端之前设置）---</span><br><span class="line">export QT_IM_MODULE=fcitx</span><br><span class="line">export GTK_IM_MODULE=fcitx</span><br><span class="line">export XMODIFIERS=@im=fcitx</span><br><span class="line"># kitty 基于 GLFW，不读 GTK/QT_IM_MODULE，只认 GLFW_IM_MODULE。</span><br><span class="line"># 设为 ibus：GLFW 走 IBus 协议，而 fcitx5 自带 IBus 兼容层，最终仍由 fcitx5 处理。</span><br><span class="line">export GLFW_IM_MODULE=ibus</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># --- 会话由 dbus-run-session 承载（见文件末尾 exec）---</span><br><span class="line"># 说明：本机从 tty 用 startx 启动，没有 systemd --user 实例，</span><br><span class="line"># 导致 /run/user/1000/bus 是个没有守护进程的死 socket。</span><br><span class="line"># 因此这里不用它，改由 dbus-run-session 建立全新的私有会话总线，</span><br><span class="line"># 并把 dwm（连同浏览器等所有子进程）都放进同一总线，fcitx5 才能被找到。</span><br><span class="line">unset DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># --- 鼠标主题（Bibata-Modern 圆润风格；可换 Amber / Ice）---</span><br><span class="line">xset r rate 300 50</span><br><span class="line">export XCURSOR_THEME=Bibata-Modern-Classic</span><br><span class="line">export XCURSOR_SIZE=24</span><br><span class="line">echo &quot;Xcursor.theme: Bibata-Modern-Classic&quot; | xrdb -merge</span><br><span class="line">echo &quot;Xcursor.size: 24&quot; | xrdb -merge</span><br><span class="line">wal -i /home/arch/Image/Pictures/walls_catppuccin/cabin-3.png</span><br><span class="line">feh --bg-fill /home/arch/Image/Pictures/walls_catppuccin/cabin-3.png</span><br><span class="line"># 键盘映射（CapsLock-&gt;Escape 等）统一由 /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/00-keyboard.conf</span><br><span class="line"># 经 localectl 管理，对所有键盘（含外接）生效，这里不再用 setxkbmap 覆盖。</span><br><span class="line"># --- 其他 ---</span><br><span class="line">#picom &amp;</span><br><span class="line">#(</span><br><span class="line">#  sleep 3</span><br><span class="line">#  exec dwmblocks</span><br><span class="line">#) &amp;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># --- 启动完整会话 ---</span><br><span class="line"># dbus-run-session 会创建新总线 -&gt; 在其中启动 fcitx5 -&gt; 再 exec dwm</span><br><span class="line">#exec dbus-run-session -- sh -c &#x27;</span><br><span class="line">#    fcitx5 -d &amp;</span><br><span class="line">#    vxwm-status &amp;</span><br><span class="line">    exec vxwm </span><br><span class="line">&#x27;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>[提醒:] 对所有xinitrc文件所有的配置要在<strong>exec dmw</strong>才会生效</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="进入TTY会话-然后startx"><a href="#进入TTY会话-然后startx" class="headerlink" title="进入TTY会话,然后startx"></a>进入TTY会话,然后startx</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">startx <span class="comment">#每次都是使用startx来进入dwm</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="进入DWM"><a href="#进入DWM" class="headerlink" title="进入DWM"></a>进入DWM</h3><blockquote>
<p>[!Note] 如果你发现你的分辨率有点奇怪</p>
</blockquote>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">xrandr <span class="comment">#查看分辨率</span></span><br><span class="line">xranr --output 显示器名称 --mode 分辨率 --rate 屏幕刷新率</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>[!Tips]建议将配置的用户和属组改成用户,修改配置不用一直要sudo</p>
</blockquote>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> <span class="built_in">chown</span> -R 用户:用户 <span class="variable">$HOME</span>/*-btw</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="dwm安装到这里就结束了"><a href="#dwm安装到这里就结束了" class="headerlink" title="dwm安装到这里就结束了"></a>dwm安装到这里就结束了</h2><ul>
<li>想要修改你的dwm配置就dwm-btw&#x2F;下的config.def.h(我推荐修改默认的配置文件)在我的博客也有我的配置文化</li>
</ul>
]]></content>
