    <title>防止误删文件</title>
    <url>/2026/01/09/rm_warn_operation/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="防止误删文件"><a href="#防止误删文件" class="headerlink" title="防止误删文件"></a>防止误删文件</h2><h3 id="trash"><a href="#trash" class="headerlink" title="trash"></a>trash</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S trash-bin <span class="comment">#arch系的安装方法</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install trahs  <span class="comment">#ubuntu系的安装方法</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="alias设置权限"><a href="#alias设置权限" class="headerlink" title="alias设置权限"></a>alias设置权限</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="variable">$0</span> <span class="comment">#查看是哪个shell</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
