  <entry>
    <title>Quick</title>
    <url>/2026/02/03/shell/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="弃暗从明"><a href="#弃暗从明" class="headerlink" title="弃暗从明"></a>弃暗从明</h2><hr>
<span id="more"></span>
<h3 id="桌面管理器"><a href="#桌面管理器" class="headerlink" title="桌面管理器"></a>桌面管理器</h3><h4 id="平铺式桌面"><a href="#平铺式桌面" class="headerlink" title="平铺式桌面"></a>平铺式桌面</h4><ul>
<li>Vxwm</li>
<li>Dwm</li>
<li>Dwm衍生物(Dwl …)</li>
<li>river</li>
<li>i3wm</li>
<li>Hyprland</li>
<li>Niri</li>
<li>…</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>[说明:] 这些平铺式桌面，很高效率的让我不用鼠标，光快捷键就能做到很多事情</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="浏览器插件-Vimium-C"><a href="#浏览器插件-Vimium-C" class="headerlink" title="浏览器插件(Vimium C)"></a>浏览器插件(Vimium C)</h4><ul>
<li>Vimium<br><img src="/image/markdown/shot_1.png" alt="Vimium|400"><blockquote>
<p>[说明:] 使用按键可以做到几乎任何操作</p>
</blockquote>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="shell-vi-mode"><a href="#shell-vi-mode" class="headerlink" title="shell vi mode"></a>shell vi mode</h3><ul>
<li>这里我推荐用fish</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="insert-Mode"><a href="#insert-Mode" class="headerlink" title="insert Mode"></a>insert Mode</h4><p><img src="/image/markdown/fish_insert_mod.png" alt="i Mode|200"></p>
<h4 id="virtual-Mode"><a href="#virtual-Mode" class="headerlink" title="virtual Mode"></a>virtual Mode</h4><p><img src="/image/markdown/shot-2026-10-21-01-04-55.png" alt="v_Mode|200"></p>
<h4 id="normal-Mode"><a href="#normal-Mode" class="headerlink" title="normal Mode"></a>normal Mode</h4><p><img src="/image/markdown/shot-2026-10-18-18-04-08.png" alt="n_Mode|200"></p>
<h4 id="配置"><a href="#配置" class="headerlink" title="配置"></a>配置</h4><ul>
<li>bash</li>
</ul>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">bind</span> -m vi-command <span class="string">&#x27;&quot;\C-l&quot;: clear-screen&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">bind</span> -m vi-insert  <span class="string">&#x27;&quot;\C-l&quot;: clear-screen&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#保留emacs的快捷键</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<ul>
<li>bash 在$HOME&#x2F;.inputrc</li>
</ul>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">set editing-mode vi</span><br><span class="line">set show-mode-in-prompt on</span><br><span class="line">set vi-ins-mode-string \1\e[6 q\2</span><br><span class="line">set vi-cmd-mode-string \1\e[2 q\2</span><br><span class="line">set keymap vi-command</span><br><span class="line">&quot;v&quot;: &quot;&quot;</span><br><span class="line">set keyseq-timeout 0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<ul>
<li>zsh</li>
</ul>
<figure class="highlight zsh"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># --- Vi mode: 光标形状 (insert=细线, normal=方块) ---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> -o vi</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">bindkey</span> -v</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># insert 模式用细线, 其他模式 (vicmd) 用方块</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> zle-keymap-<span class="function"><span class="title">select</span></span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">case</span> <span class="variable">$KEYMAP</span> <span class="keyword">in</span></span><br><span class="line">    vicmd)      <span class="built_in">printf</span> <span class="string">&#x27;\e[2 q&#x27;</span> ;;  <span class="comment"># 方块 = normal/command 模式</span></span><br><span class="line">    main|viins) <span class="built_in">printf</span> <span class="string">&#x27;\e[5 q&#x27;</span> ;;  <span class="comment"># 细线 = insert 模式</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">esac</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">zle</span> -N zle-keymap-select</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 进入/退出 ZLE 时也修正一次, 避免残留错误形状</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> zle-line-<span class="function"><span class="title">init</span></span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">zle</span> -K viins                        <span class="comment"># 每次新提示符回到 insert 模式</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">printf</span> <span class="string">&#x27;\e[5 q&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">zle</span> -N zle-line-init</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 接受命令后恢复细线</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> zle-line-<span class="function"><span class="title">finish</span></span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">printf</span> <span class="string">&#x27;\e[5 q&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">zle</span> -N zle-line-finish</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<ul>
<li>fish</li>
</ul>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> -g fish_key_bindings fish_vi_key_bindings</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>[推荐：]纯快的话我是会选择fish,但是我时常要写shell脚本所有一般是bash和fish都用了，但是bash你按v键他不会有virtual模式选择不了</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="启动器"><a href="#启动器" class="headerlink" title="启动器"></a>启动器</h3><ul>
<li>wofi</li>
<li>rofi</li>
<li>dmene(dwm类需要安装)</li>
<li>wmenu</li>
<li>….</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="个人自定义脚本"><a href="#个人自定义脚本" class="headerlink" title="个人自定义脚本"></a>个人自定义脚本</h3><ul>
<li>有剪贴板历史</li>
<li>有快速打开网站</li>
<li>快速打开指定配置文件&#x2F;文件夹</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="高效率软件"><a href="#高效率软件" class="headerlink" title="高效率软件"></a>高效率软件</h3><ul>
<li>lsd</li>
<li>fzf</li>
<li>nvim</li>
<li>curl</li>
<li>git</li>
</ul>
]]></content>
